(1)  162/    43C8 :                     ; Interestingly, this lines up with our knowledge of the fabled
(1)  163/    43C8 :                     ; Tokyo Game Show prototype.
(1)  164/    43C8 :                     ; See it in action: https://youtu.be/S8_IAfQbUu0
