(1)   36/    8AC4 :                     		; This is too wide, causing the player to teleport downwards when
(1)   37/    8AC4 :                     		; running off the platform. Sonic 1 used a width of 48 for the
(1)   38/    8AC4 :                     		; collision and 100 for obActWid, but in Sonic 2 they must be
(1)   39/    8AC4 :                     		; the same. 100 seems to be overkill, as 48 still results in good
(1)   40/    8AC4 :                     		; sprite culling.
