   12720/   1A824 :                     ; ZONE ANIMATION PROCEDURES AND SCRIPTS
   12721/   1A824 :                     ;
   12722/   1A824 :                     ; Each zone gets two entries in this jump table. The first entry points to the
   12723/   1A824 :                     ; zone's animation procedure (usually Dynamic_Null, AKA none). The second points
   12724/   1A824 :                     ; to the zone's animation script.
   12725/   1A824 :                     ;
   12726/   1A824 :                     ; Seems like stage IDs were already being shifted, since listings for $07-$0F
   12727/   1A824 :                     ; can be found, alongside HPZ's art listed from $08 (its ID in the final).
   12728/   1A824 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   12729/   1A824 :                     DynArtCue_Index:
   12730/   1A824 : 0042                		dc.w Dynamic_NullGHZ-DynArtCue_Index	; GHZ
   12731/   1A826 : 00AC                		dc.w AnimCue_EHZ-DynArtCue_Index		; GHZ
   12732/   1A828 : 0040                		dc.w Dynamic_Null-DynArtCue_Index		; LZ
   12733/   1A82A : 0136                		dc.w AnimCue_CPZ_Boss-DynArtCue_Index	; LZ
   12734/   1A82C : 0040                		dc.w Dynamic_Null-DynArtCue_Index		; CPZ
