   15832/   19A4C :                     ; ZONE ANIMATION PROCEDURES AND SCRIPTS
   15833/   19A4C :                     ;
   15834/   19A4C :                     ; Each zone gets two entries in this jump table. The first entry points to the
   15835/   19A4C :                     ; zone's animation procedure (usually Dynamic_Null, AKA none). The second points
   15836/   19A4C :                     ; to the zone's animation script.
   15837/   19A4C :                     ;
   15838/   19A4C :                     ; Seems like stage IDs were already being shifted, since listings for $07-$0F
   15839/   19A4C :                     ; can be found, alongside HPZ's art listed from $08 (its ID in the final).
   15840/   19A4C :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
