   16085/   19BEA :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   16086/   19BEA :                     ; This seems to be a subroutine that would've shifted the background blocks
   16087/   19BEA :                     ; of Chemical Plant Zone once the player reached a certain X position,
   16088/   19BEA :                     ; lasting exactly two screens. This can also be found in the final at
   16089/   19BEA :                     ; $40200 in the ROM, with the only difference being its level ID, which
   16090/   19BEA :                     ; was updated to match Chemical Plant's final ID ($0D instead of 02)
   16091/   19BEA :                     ;
   16092/   19BEA :                     ; To see the effect for yourself, add a branch to it at the
   16093/   19BEA :                     ; start of LoadTilesAsYouMove and change $FFFF7500/$FFFF7D00 to
   16094/   19BEA :                     ; $FFFF0000/$FFFF0800 (to make it more visible)
   16095/   19BEA :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   16096/   19BEA :                     
