(1) 1723/   724D2 :                     ; Strangely, despite this driver being SMPS 68k Type 1b,
(1) 1724/   724D2 :                     ; WriteFMI and WriteFMII are the Type 1a versions.
(1) 1725/   724D2 :                     ; In Sonic 1's prototype, they were the Type 1b versions.
(1) 1726/   724D2 :                     ; I wonder why they were changed?
